      "space": "guest",
      "note": "The pool's first block, indices 0 to 16383; the overflow block below holds the rest."
    },
    {
      "name": "d3d9 overflow objects",
      "header": "runtime/sa2_d3d9.h",
      "base": "SA2_D3D9_OBJ_OVF_BASE",
      "stride": "SA2_D3D9_OBJ_STRIDE",
      "count": "SA2_D3D9_OBJ_OVF_COUNT",
      "space": "guest",
      "note": "The pool's second block, indices 16384 and up, in the low free space below the import thunks (runtime/sa2_d3d9.h). The first 16384 objects keep the first block's addresses, so a run that builds no more is unchanged by it."
    },
